                <div class="achievement-item">
                    <span class="achievement-icon">◈</span>
                    <span>Completed multiple software and game development projects independently</span>
                </div>
                <div class="achievement-item">
                    <span class="achievement-icon">◈</span>
                    <span>Recognized for creativity and technical problem solving in academic projects</span>
                </div>
                <div class="achievement-item">
                    <span class="achievement-icon">◈</span>
